# Loaded by `vite build`, not by the dev server.
#
# One absolute URL serves both targets. From the web app it is same-origin, so the browser
# never performs a CORS check. From the Capacitor WebView, which loads from https://localhost,
# it is cross-origin — which is why the Worker sets the header on image responses itself.
#
# Dev deliberately has no value here: paths stay relative and Vite serves the ~23,000 files
# out of client/public, so local work needs no network and no bucket.
VITE_IMAGE_BASE_URL=https://pokemans.utsec.net/images
